    <briefdescription>
<para>A template class for an optional input port with optimized binding. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classscc_1_1sc__inout__opt" kindref="compound">sc_inout_opt</ref> class is a specialization of sc_core::sc_inout that allows optional binding of 1 port or signal at max.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The data type of the input port. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
